	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The paper used “an AI-ECG algorithm that was previously developed and validated in the non-transplant population” and states that “the convolutional neural network model was developed using Keras with a TensorFlow and Python backend.” Raw 12-lead ECGs were input to estimate ECG age. The model was applied without additional training to this transplant cohort. No SHAP/LIME-type explainability or hyperparameter-tuning process for this study cohort was reported. Validation here is best marked as not reported because this paper is primarily an application/prognostic study of a previously developed model rather than a new derivation-validation paper.  ￼

Section 4: AI Quality & Reproducibility (CONVINCE Standards)
